T1  - Clinical summarization from FHIR bundles using model context protocol–orchestrated large language models: A scenario-based physician validation study
AU  - Ferreira, João C.
AU  - Maia, Luís
AU  - Correia, Ricardo
AU  - Vilas, Alberto
AU  - Matos, Joana
AU  - Vila-Chã, Nuno
