T1  - EarlyExodus: Leveraging early exits to mitigate backdoor vulnerability in deep learning
AU  - Douch, Salmane
AU  - Abid, M. Riduan
AU  - Zine-Dine, Khalid
AU  - Bouzidi, Driss
AU  - El Aidos, Fatima Ezzahra
