T1  - Virtual Reality Therapy Assistants for Adjunctive Cue Exposure Training in the Treatment of Alcohol Use Disorder (VITAACue-AUD): Protocol for a Technical Feasibility Study
AU  - Kammler-Sücker, Kornelius I
AU  - Heizmann, Carolin
AU  - Eidenmueller, Katharina
AU  - Werner, Leon
AU  - Prexl, Thomas
AU  - Rust, Frank
