T1  - GAIA-chain: generative-AI and blockchain for autonomous task execution and resource allocation in UAV-assisted IoV
AU  - Ullah, Inam
AU  - Su, Xin
AU  - Haider, Zeeshan Ali
AU  - Arishi, Ali
AU  - Pedrycz, Witold
JO  - Digital Communications and Networks
PY  - 2026
